#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:2
msgid "JSON"
msgstr "JSON"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:4
msgid ""
"JSON (JavaScript Object Notation) is a compact, human-readable text format "
"for structured data. It defines six types -- *string*, *number*, *boolean*, "
"*null*, *array*, and *object* -- each of which maps directly onto a Python "
"value, so converting between Python and JSON is a single function call in "
"either direction."
msgstr ""
"JSON（JavaScript Object Notation）是一種精簡、人類可讀的結構化資料文字格式。它定義了六種型別 -- *string*\\ "
"、\\ *number*\\ 、\\ *boolean*\\ 、\\ *null*\\ 、\\ *array* 與 *object* -- "
"每一種都直接對應到一個 Python 值，因此在 Python 與 JSON 之間的轉換，無論哪個方向都只需呼叫一個函式。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:11
msgid ""
"JSON is the lingua franca of config files and web APIs. Reach for it "
"whenever you need to save a small bundle of settings to disk in a form you "
"can also read by eye, or to exchange structured data with another program."
msgstr ""
"JSON 是設定檔與 Web API "
"的通用語言。每當你需要把一小組設定以同時也能用肉眼閱讀的形式儲存到磁碟，或要與另一個程式交換結構化資料時，都可以採用它。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:16
msgid "Two functions cover most needs:"
msgstr "兩個函式就能涵蓋大多數的需求："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:18
msgid ""
":func:`json.dumps` -- *dump string*: turn a Python value into a JSON string."
msgstr ":func:`json.dumps` -- *dump string*\\ ：把一個 Python 值轉成 JSON 字串。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:20
msgid ""
":func:`json.loads` -- *load string*: parse a JSON string back into Python."
msgstr ":func:`json.loads` -- *load string*\\ ：把一個 JSON 字串解析回 Python。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:23
msgid ""
"The pair ``json.dump`` / ``json.load`` (no ``s``) does the same job but "
"takes a file object directly."
msgstr "``json.dump`` / ``json.load``\\ （沒有 ``s``\\ ）這一組做的是同樣的工作，但直接接受一個檔案物件。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:27
msgid "Encoding (dumps)"
msgstr "編碼（dumps）"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:42
#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:77
msgid "Output::"
msgstr "輸出::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:46
msgid "The mapping is:"
msgstr "對應關係為："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:48
msgid ":class:`dict` (string keys) → JSON object."
msgstr ":class:`dict`\\ （字串鍵）→ JSON object。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:49
msgid ":class:`list` and :class:`tuple` → JSON array."
msgstr ":class:`list` 與 :class:`tuple` → JSON array。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:50
msgid ":class:`str` → JSON string."
msgstr ":class:`str` → JSON string。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:51
msgid ":class:`int`, :class:`float` → JSON number."
msgstr ":class:`int`\\ 、\\ :class:`float` → JSON number。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:52
msgid ""
":data:`True`, :data:`False`, :data:`None` → ``true``, ``false``, ``null``."
msgstr ""
":data:`True`\\ 、\\ :data:`False`\\ 、\\ :data:`None` → ``true``\\ 、\\ "
"``false``\\ 、\\ ``null``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:55
msgid ""
"Anything outside that set (a custom class, a :class:`bytes` buffer, a "
":class:`set`) raises :exc:`TypeError`. Convert the value first."
msgstr ""
"超出這個集合的任何東西（自訂類別、\\ :class:`bytes` 緩衝區、\\ :class:`set`\\ ）都會引發 "
":exc:`TypeError`\\ 。請先轉換該值。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:61
msgid ""
"CPython's :func:`json.dumps` accepts an ``indent`` argument for pretty-"
"printed output; MicroPython's does not. The only formatting knob is "
"``separators``, which controls the in-line spacing -- pass ``(',', ':')`` "
"for the most compact form. Multi-line, indented output has to be produced by"
" hand if needed."
msgstr ""
"CPython 的 :func:`json.dumps` 接受一個 ``indent`` 引數以產生美化排版的輸出；MicroPython "
"的則不接受。唯一的格式化旋鈕是 ``separators``\\ ，它控制行內的間距 -- 傳入 ``(',', ':')`` "
"可得到最精簡的形式。如有需要，多行、帶縮排的輸出必須以手動方式產生。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:69
msgid "Decoding (loads)"
msgstr "解碼（loads）"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:81
msgid ""
"JSON objects become :class:`dict`, arrays become :class:`list`, and the rest"
" map back to their Python equivalents. Bad JSON raises :exc:`ValueError`."
msgstr ""
"JSON object 會變成 :class:`dict`\\ ，array 會變成 :class:`list`\\ ，其餘的則對應回它們的 "
"Python 等價物。不良的 JSON 會引發 :exc:`ValueError`\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:86
msgid "Reading and writing files"
msgstr "讀取與寫入檔案"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:88
msgid "The file-based pair plays nicely with ``with``:"
msgstr "以檔案為基礎的這一組與 ``with`` 配合得很好："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/python/files-and-data/json.rst:102
msgid ""
"Treat the JSON file as a complete record -- read it in, modify the Python "
"value, write it back. Trying to edit JSON in place inside a file usually "
"creates more bugs than it saves."
msgstr ""
"請把 JSON 檔當成一筆完整的紀錄來處理 -- 讀進來、修改 Python 值、再寫回去。試圖在檔案內就地編輯 "
"JSON，通常製造的錯誤會比省下的還多。"
